        "openmrs_entity_id": "",
        "type": "toaster_notes",
        "text": "Reducing Salt Intake \u2014 Target: less than 1 teaspoon (5g) per day\n\nInstead of salt, try local spices: pilipili hoho (bell pepper), tangawizi (ginger), bizari (cumin), mdalasini (cinnamon). Avoid adding salt at the table. Reduce use of stock cubes and processed/packaged foods \u2014 these are high in hidden salt.",
        "toaster_type": "info",
        "relevance": {
          "rules-engine": {
            "ex-rules": {
              "rules-file": "ncd_followup_lifestyle_relevance.yml"
            }
          }
        }
      },
