        "text": "Reducing Sugar Intake \u2014 Target: less than 5 teaspoons per day\n\nReduce sugar in tea and porridge gradually. Choose fresh fruits over sweetened drinks or juice. Avoid soda and bottled juice. When buying packaged food, check whether sugar is listed in the first three ingredients.",
