        "text": "Increasing Physical Activity \u2014 Target: at least 30 minutes per day, until sweating\n\nBrisk walking, farming, fetching water, sweeping, and dancing all count. Start with 10 minutes three times a day if 30 minutes at once feels difficult. Walking to the market or clinic instead of taking transport is a great way to add activity.",
